1
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,079
Stop!

2
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,319
Professor Chen.

3
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:22,519
So it really was you.

4
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:29,640
I've waited a long time for this day.

5
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:33,480
Afraid it would come,

6
00:01:34,159 --> 00:01:35,200
yet afraid it wouldn't.

7
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:39,079
Gu Yan,

8
00:01:41,079 --> 00:01:42,400
you suspected it was me all along, didn't you?

9
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,159
Yes.

10
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:46,879
I did.

11
00:01:48,319 --> 00:01:49,519
But I don't understand...

12
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:53,120
Why did you harm my mother?

13
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,040
About your mother...

14
00:02:00,799 --> 00:02:01,480
I'm so sorry.

15
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:05,359
Gu Yan,

16
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:08,719
I failed you.

17
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:11,120
I'm sorry.

18
00:02:11,879 --> 00:02:12,879
I'm so sorry.

19
00:02:13,159 --> 00:02:14,520
What's the point of saying sorry?

20
00:02:14,599 --> 00:02:16,439
My mother is never coming back!

21
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:19,080
And you deceived me for 13 years!

22
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,879
You were right in front of me the whole time,

23
00:02:21,159 --> 00:02:22,520
yet I had no idea!

24
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:27,400
You were my most trusted mentor.

25
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:31,199
You taught all my core courses.

26
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:33,199
How could you do this to me?

27
00:02:36,759 --> 00:02:37,080
Come in.

28
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:41,639
Professor Chen.

29
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:43,960
Gu Yan.

30
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,080
What happened to your leg?

31
00:02:50,039 --> 00:02:50,520
It's fractured.

32
00:02:50,759 --> 00:02:51,879
I'll be fine after resting for a while.

33
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:55,159
No wonder you were in a rush to find an assistant.

34
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,759
It takes a hundred days to heal broken bones.

35
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:00,879
You should...

36
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,039
get plenty of rest.

37
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,479
Okay.

38
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:08,719
Thank you, Professor.

39
00:03:13,759 --> 00:03:14,960
Your mother, Fang Lan, and I...

40
00:03:15,599 --> 00:03:16,560
were old friends for years.

41
00:03:17,439 --> 00:03:18,800
I wanted to look after you for her,

42
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:20,759
but look at you now...

43
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:23,680
Don't worry.

44
00:03:24,319 --> 00:03:25,039
I know what I'm doing.

45
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:27,039
By the way,

46
00:03:27,639 --> 00:03:28,599
I wanted to ask you about someone.

47
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:30,759
Who?

48
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,560
I'm not sure which student it was,

49
00:03:35,439 --> 00:03:36,680
but he was very well-mannered.

50
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:39,080
Seeing that I was struggling just now,

51
00:03:39,439 --> 00:03:40,599
he went out of his way to help me.

52
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,319
The students at our university

53
00:03:43,599 --> 00:03:44,639
are generally quite well-mannered.

54
00:03:45,039 --> 00:03:45,479
Besides,

55
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:46,680
it's only right.

56
00:03:50,039 --> 00:03:50,919
He looked quite clean-cut,

57
00:03:51,719 --> 00:03:52,479
tall and lean,

58
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:54,039
around 175 centimeters.

59
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:58,439
Gu Yan,

60
00:03:59,639 --> 00:04:01,280
you didn't fall in love at first sight, did you?

61
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:03,919
How about later

62
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,080
I pull up the security footage

63
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,560
to check who this student is?

64
00:04:07,759 --> 00:04:08,719
That won't be necessary.

65
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:10,280
Here, have some water.

66
00:04:11,199 --> 00:04:12,039
Thank you, Professor.

67
00:04:12,039 --> 00:04:12,639
Make yourself at home.

68
00:04:12,879 --> 00:04:13,319
I'll go cook.

69
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:13,840
It won't take long.

70
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:14,960
Thanks, Professor.

71
00:04:16,319 --> 00:04:17,639
Hey, Chen!

72
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:19,399
I made bone broth.

73
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:20,199
Come and taste it!

74
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,439
Oh, you have a guest today?

75
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:28,000
You must be Professor Yang Lifang, who teaches sociology?

76
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:30,120
I'm Gu Yan, one of Professor Chen's students.

77
00:04:31,199 --> 00:04:32,480
Professor Chen has indeed taught

78
00:04:32,519 --> 00:04:33,600
many outstanding students.

79
00:04:34,079 --> 00:04:34,439
Here,

80
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:36,519
you're in for a treat with the bone broth I made today.

81
00:04:36,639 --> 00:04:37,240
Come try some.

82
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:37,639
Oh, wow.

83
00:04:37,879 --> 00:04:38,480
Looks wonderful.

84
00:04:38,839 --> 00:04:39,399
Don't mind if I do.

85
00:04:39,399 --> 00:04:39,800
Great.

86
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,160
Well, Professor Yang,

87
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,240
you two chat for a bit.

88
00:04:42,519 --> 00:04:42,959
Dinner will be ready soon.

89
00:04:42,959 --> 00:04:43,240
Okay.

90
00:04:44,519 --> 00:04:45,040
Have some food, Gu Yan.

91
00:04:45,519 --> 00:04:46,079
Professor Chen,

92
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:47,000
you're always alone,

93
00:04:47,519 --> 00:04:48,560
with no one to look after you.

94
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:49,680
Now,

95
00:04:49,879 --> 00:04:50,800
seeing you here,

96
00:04:51,319 --> 00:04:52,160
I feel much more relieved.

97
00:04:54,639 --> 00:04:55,079
Well,

98
00:04:56,279 --> 00:04:56,639
eat up.

99
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:57,759
Help yourself.

100
00:04:58,279 --> 00:04:58,800
Come on.

101
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:12,160
Wait.

102
00:05:15,319 --> 00:05:16,360
Who's your accomplice?

103
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,399
I don't have an accomplice.

104
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:22,120
I acted alone.

105
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:25,480
I did everything by myself.

106
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:27,519
Your accomplice...

107
00:05:27,879 --> 00:05:29,600
is the boy in that photo with you.

108
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,360
The photo on the entryway cabinet.

109
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,079
You mean...

110
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:36,480
the photo of Shen Yu and me?

111
00:05:37,399 --> 00:05:38,600
Who said that was Shen Yu?

112
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,600
The boy in the photo was 13 or 14.

113
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,759
Back then, Shen Yu...

114
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:44,000
was sent abroad by his mother to study.

115
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,360
How could he possibly be

116
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,480
in a photo with you?

117
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:48,920
Or rather...

118
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:52,199
I never took a photo with Professor Chen.

119
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,120
So what?

120
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,480
That doesn't prove anything.

121
00:06:01,079 --> 00:06:01,879
Take me away.

122
00:06:03,399 --> 00:06:04,120
Maurice.

123
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:33,600
It's all right.

124
00:06:35,759 --> 00:06:37,560
We'll find out the truth soon.

125
00:06:42,759 --> 00:06:43,519
Gu Yan,

126
00:06:43,519 --> 00:06:44,240
when did you

127
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,680
start suspecting Chen Yanzhi?

128
00:06:46,759 --> 00:06:48,720
I went to see Chen Yanzhi once

129
00:06:49,279 --> 00:06:50,279
to consult him on

130
00:06:50,519 --> 00:06:52,319
how to lure out the serial killer.

131
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:53,680
He told me

132
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:54,879
it was too dangerous,

133
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:57,120
and urged me to stop digging.

134
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:59,720
Now that you know you're his target,

135
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:01,720
catching him

136
00:07:02,199 --> 00:07:03,519
will come at a price.

137
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:07,000
A life for a life.

138
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:12,720
Have some tea.

139
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:15,959
The guilt he showed back then

140
00:07:16,519 --> 00:07:17,920
made me suspicious.

141
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:20,000
As the person who knew my past best

142
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,680
and an old friend of my mother's,

143
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,959
why would he still feel so guilty

144
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,879
after all these years?

145
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:28,639
When facing a late friend's child,

146
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:30,399
one would normally feel sympathy

147
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:31,240
and regret.

148
00:07:31,639 --> 00:07:32,439
When you went to Chen Yanzhi's

149
00:07:32,439 --> 00:07:33,439
faculty dorm yesterday,

150
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:34,920
there was a female teacher named Yang.

151
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:35,759
I looked into her.

152
00:07:37,279 --> 00:07:37,639
Right.

153
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:39,959
After that visit,

154
00:07:40,879 --> 00:07:42,160
my suspicions grew even stronger.

155
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,319
Because he started lying to me.

156
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:45,839
Lying?

157
00:07:46,439 --> 00:07:48,560
Even a criminal psychology professor slipped up?

158
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:51,480
Chen Yanzhi has stayed single for years

159
00:07:52,319 --> 00:07:53,160
and has no children.

160
00:07:54,199 --> 00:07:55,199
When I visited him,

161
00:07:55,839 --> 00:07:56,879
I ran into Professor Yang.

162
00:07:57,879 --> 00:07:59,040
Professor Yang has feelings for him,

163
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:00,680
but Chen Yanzhi

164
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,079
has no interest in her.

165
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:05,360
I intentionally hinted they were close,

166
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:07,360
yet Chen Yanzhi didn't react.

167
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:10,079
Because he deliberately wanted me to see

168
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:11,879
that he had a woman around him.

169
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:13,680
Gu Yan,

170
00:08:14,079 --> 00:08:14,439
have some food.

171
00:08:16,519 --> 00:08:17,560
Have some too, Chen.

172
00:08:19,319 --> 00:08:20,600
I've got it.

173
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:22,480
You...

174
00:08:22,639 --> 00:08:23,160
You two eat, too.

175
00:08:23,639 --> 00:08:24,319
Have some food, Gu Yan.

176
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:25,680
Professor Chen,

177
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:26,680
you're always alone,

178
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,120
with no one to look after you.

179
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:29,680
Now, seeing someone here,

180
00:08:29,959 --> 00:08:30,839
I feel much more relieved.

181
00:08:36,279 --> 00:08:36,960
Eat up.

182
00:08:37,279 --> 00:08:38,000
Help yourself.

183
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:39,559
He's 60 years old.

184
00:08:40,159 --> 00:08:41,120
He probably didn't want anyone

185
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:42,679
to know about his awkward situation.

186
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:44,960
That's because

187
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,080
he isn't attracted to women.

188
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:51,200
How do you know that?

189
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:54,440
Compared to average men,

190
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:56,519
he's far more particular about cleanliness and order.

191
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,240
Every time I met him,

192
00:08:59,080 --> 00:08:59,879
I noticed

193
00:09:00,559 --> 00:09:01,840
his impeccably clean clothes,

194
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:03,679
his spotless furniture,

195
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:05,440
and his meticulously groomed hair.

196
00:09:06,799 --> 00:09:07,639
Most importantly,

197
00:09:08,559 --> 00:09:10,080
I also saw a book at his place.

198
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:13,240
The title was Maurice,

199
00:09:14,519 --> 00:09:16,519
by the British author Forster.
